    slug: "fsae-fdm-to-sls-suspension-mounts",
    title: "A Formula SAE team swapping FDM for SLS on suspension mounts",
    subtitle: "Why $180 of nylon parts beat $12 of PLA on a car that has to finish a race",
    category: "case-study",
    author: "3DBuildBot Engineering",
